      "description": "* Lead developer and creator of SpacecRAFT, a high-performance, in-memory distributed system based on the RAFT protocol driving financial and operational efficiencies by reducing system downtime and support hours. SpacecRAFT has allowed for a multi-million dollar reduction in operating expenses, making it possible for the company to expand in other areas of interest and grow with lower marginal costs per user.\n* Lead developer and creator of Rhino Accounts, an OpenID Connect compliant auth provider with over 3 million users used by dozens of first and third-party services at McNeel, including Rhino itself.\n* Developed the edsApp framework, a flexible front-end JavaScript framework enabling simple, fast, and powerful single page applications for internal and external purposes at McNeel.\n* Collaborate with cross-functional teams to design and implement end-to-end software solutions.\n* Mentor junior developers and foster a culture of continuous learning and improvement.",
